ntense, I think it's time to chill a little and watch some of my favorite let's play kinda folks.\n\nJust before I head off Twitter for the night don't forget #BlackLivesMatter and we've gotta fight for the justice deserved in this world.","userId":770244397615058946,"media":null,"username":"LiteralGrill","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":5,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1267638888597684226,"date":1591063637000,"rawContent":"Grill says #TransRightsAreHumanRights and #BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/0foKX4Xmvu","userId":770244397615058946,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EZeO2SUWsAExQ8n?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"LiteralGrill","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1267833326724943872,"date":1591109994000,"rawContent":"Okay, I've had a hell of a morning. I gotta get to my morning workout so I can be ready and prepped to get electrolysis later so here's a last reminder that Stonewall was a riot and #BlackLivesMatter till I can rejoin the fight later.","userId":770244397615058946,"media":null,"username":"LiteralGrill","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1267865896732762114,"date":1591117760000,"rawContent":"Don't let people get away with these kinds of behaviors. Make them understand for those who are BIPOC can't just walk away from this. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":770244397615058946,"media":null,"username":"LiteralGrill","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1268537831749824513,"date":1591277962000,"rawContent":"Anyways good morning all my BBQTs! Remember no racists are allowed at my grillouts ever.\n\nI got a big day incoming, supposed to test out my new leg. Might bring it home? We'll see how many adjustments must be made. \n\nOh, and #BlackLivesMatter","userId":770244397615058946,"media":null,"username":"LiteralGrill","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1268608632796651526,"date":1591294842000,"rawContent":"At the appointment, going to be trying my new leg soon! Nervous but excited. I promise I'll fill everyone in when I can!\n\nTill then, #BlackLivesMatter","userId":770244397615058946,"media":null,"username":"LiteralGrill","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":9.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1269348416955518978,"date":1591471220000,"rawContent"